         <p>(C) <b style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold;">Preparatory Steps:</b></p>
         <table cellpadding="3">
            <tr>
          <th style="width:6%;">Sr. No.</th>
            <th style="width:66%;">Preparatory Work</th>
            <th style="width:13%;">Action by</th>
            <th style="width:10%;">Check</th>
            </tr>
      
            <tr>
                <td>1</td>
                <td>Ensure compliance to all MGL Life Saving Rule &amp; COP requirements. Conduct Site specific HIRA is prepared for NRO and briefed to all concerned at site 
                    <b>(Refer COP section 03 - Excavation &amp; Deep Excavation)</b>.</td>
                <td>Project Engineer</td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>2</td>
                <td>Ensure all the valves are accessible to be operated and in correct position at the start of NRO.</td>
                <td>Project/O&amp;M Engineer</td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>3</td>
                <td>Ensure NRO procedure is approved by competent authority and issued to concerned personnel at site.</td>
                <td>Project/O&amp;M Engineer</td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>4</td>
                <td>Ensure that all the personnel involved in the gas venting operation are briefed regarding the sequence of the operation and are aware of the valve positions.</td>
                <td>Project/O&amp;M Engineer</td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>5</td>
                <td>Ensure proper earthing of the vent hose during the venting operation.</td>
                <td>Project Engineer</td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>6</td>
                <td>Ensure No smoking / No Naked Flame sign boards and barricading are available at site.</td>
                <td>Project Engineer</td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>7</td>
                <td>Ensure Leak Surveyor (Gasco-seeker) &amp; O2 meters are available at site with Valid Calibration.</td>
                <td>Project Engineer</td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>8</td>
                <td>Ensure appropriate nos. of Fire Extinguishers (9 kg-4 nos) and appropriate non sparking tools are available at site.</td>
                <td>Project Engineer</td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>9</td>
                <td>Ensure all emergency fittings are available at site.</td>
                <td>Project Engineer</td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>10</td>
                <td>Ensure that pipeline construction and testing are completed.</td>
                <td>Project Engineer</td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>11</td>
                <td>Ensure all personnel involved in NRO are wearing their recommended PPE as per COP section 01 - Safety specific requirement (clause no. 6.0 - Personal Protective Equipment).</td>
                <td>Project/O&amp;M Engineer</td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>12</td>
                <td>Ensure tag out of valve SOV1 and continuous barricading &amp; monitoring during NRO as per SCO - 03 Procedure for Non routine operations.</td>
                <td>Project/O&amp;M Engineer</td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
    </table>
