         <p>(E) <b style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold;">Normal Operation Procedure:</b></p>
        
                   <table>
        <tr>
             <th style="width:10%;">Sr. No.</th>
            <th style="width:66%;">Operation Procedure</th>
            <th style="width:11%;">Action by</th>
            <th style="width:10%;">Check</th>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td >1</td>
            <td>Inform HOD (O&amp;M) &amp; Emergency control room about commencement of NRO.</td>
            <td >DIC</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td >2</td>
            <td>
                Ensure positive pressure (AIR) of 2 bar at all purging points.
                Check positive pressure at PP1, PP2, PP3, PP4, PP5.
            </td>
            <td >AIC / DIC</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td >3</td>
            <td>Ensure fire extinguishers (10 kgs – 2 nos.) are in place.</td>
            <td >AIC</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td >4</td>
            <td>
                Depressurize the line by operating purge points valve at
                PP1, PP3, PP4 &amp; PP5.
            </td>
            <td >AIC</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td >5</td>
            <td>Close all the purge point valves after Depressurizing.</td>
            <td >AIC</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td >6</td>
            <td>
                Raise self-authorization permit to carry out hook-up activity
                with existing gasified pipeline.<br/>
                Ensure Zero PPM of Gas at A-A location.<br/>
                Close the Valve SOV1 &amp; SOV2.
            </td>
            <td >AIC / DIC</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td >7</td>
            <td>
                Ensure no naked flame / ignition source in the vicinity of trench.
